<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: CRICKET-INDIA 171-1 AT CLOSE V W.INDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 171-1 AT CLOSE V W.INDIES.</headline>
<dateline>PORT OF SPAIN 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 171-1 in reply to West Indies' first innings total of 296 all out at the close on the second day of the second test match on Saturday.</p>
</text>
